      en: "Cincinatti Agricultural Plantations, in Grand Gedeh County near Zwedru, are a major agricultural venture focusing on palm oil, rubber, and coffee. Started in 2010 with Dutch investment, the plantations cover 10,000 hectares. They employ over 1,000 workers and operate a palm oil mill. Products are processed locally and exported. The project aims for sustainability with RSPO certification. Land disputes with local communities have been a challenge.",
